# ======================= data & runtime artifacts (regenerable) ===============
# The warehouse, extracted source snapshots and staging pickles are generated by
# `python -m etl.cli init` + the seeding run. data/db/warehouse.db alone is
# ~390 MB, above GitHub's 100 MB per-file hard limit, so it must not be tracked.
data/
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.pkl
*.log
logs/

